flowchart LR
    A[Clarify .NET scope] --> B[Architecture design/review subprocess]
    B --> C[.NET implementation slice subprocess]
    C --> D[Peer review]
    D --> E{QA validation}
    E -- quality accepted --> F[Security review]
    E -- quality accepted --> G[Run command writeback]
    G --> H[UI screenshot writeback]
    F --> I[Release approval]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Release rollout]
    J --> K[Post-release learning]
    E -- repair required --> L[Repair findings]
    L --> M{QA recheck}
    M -- quality accepted --> N[Security review after repair]
    M -- quality accepted --> O[Run command writeback after repair]
    O --> P[UI screenshot writeback after repair]
    N --> Q[Release approval after repair]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[Repaired rollout]
    R --> S[Repaired learning]
    M -- repair escalation --> T[Repair escalation]
